    "body": "## Summary\n\n- add Megatron Bridge 0.7.0 to the documentation version picker\n- make 0.7.0 the sole latest and preferred version\n- remove the latest and preferred markers from 0.6.0\n- remove the stale latest marker from 0.5.1\n- keep `nightly` as the main-branch docs identity\n\n## Why\n\n`src/megatron/bridge/package_info.py` is at 0.7.0, while the documentation picker still identifies earlier releases as latest and marks 0.6.0 as preferred.\n\n## Validation\n\n- validated that 0.7.0 is the only entry marked latest and preferred\n- `uv run --no-project --with pre-commit pre-commit run --all-files`\n- `git diff --check`",
